{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T17:48:11.057Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## interface/wifi **Type:** Directory":"## interface/wifi \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/wifi/wps-push-button **Type:** Command":"## interface/wifi/wps-push-button \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/wireguard **Type:** Directory":"## interface/wireguard \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/wireguard/peers **Type:** Directory":"## interface/wireguard/peers \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/wireguard/peers/show-client-config **Type:** Command":"## interface/wireguard/peers/show-client-config \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/wireguard/wg-export **Type:** Command":"## interface/wireguard/wg-export \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/wireguard/wg-import **Type:** Command":"## interface/wireguard/wg-import \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/wireless/access-list **Package:** wireless-rep **Type:** Directory":"## interface/wireless/access-list \n**包：** wireless-rep\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/wireless/align/monitor **Package:** wireless-rep **Type:** Command":"## interface/wireless/align/monitor \n**包：** wireless-rep\n**类型：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/wireless/align/test-audio **Package:** wireless-rep **Type:** Command":"## interface/wireless/align/test-audio \n**包：** wireless-rep\n**类型：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000PPPoE Scanner allows scanning all active PPPoE servers in the layer2 broadcast domain.":"PPPoE Scanner 可扫描第 2 层广播域中所有活动的 PPPoE 服务器。","docs-7.25\u0000When you specify the VLAN IDs, the PPPoE server will accept 802.1Q tagged packets from clients, and it will reply using the same VLAN. You then have an option to accept or drop untagged PPPoE clients on the same interface using the `accept-untagged` property. You can configure the PPPoE server with `pppoe-over-vlan-range` setting even on VLAN interface enabling the QinQ setups as well. But keep in mind that the inner VLAN tag should be 802.1Q. </ArgTableRow> <ArgTableRow arg=\"accept-untagged\" typ=\"bool\">Whether to accept untagged(non-VLAN) PPPoE packets on the interface when `pppoe-over-vlan-range` is specified.</ArgTableRow> </ArgTable>":"指定 VLAN ID 后，PPPoE 服务器将接受来自客户端的 802.1Q 标记数据包，并使用相同的 VLAN 进行回复。然后，可以使用 `accept-untagged` 属性选择在同一接口上接受或丢弃未标记的 PPPoE 客户端。  \n即使是在 VLAN 接口上，也可以使用 `pppoe-over-vlan-range` 设置配置 PPPoE 服务器，从而支持 QinQ 配置。但请注意，内层 VLAN 标记应为 802.1Q。\n</ArgTableRow>\n<ArgTableRow arg=\"accept-untagged\" typ=\"bool\">指定 `pppoe-over-vlan-range` 时，是否接受接口上的未标记（非 VLAN）PPPoE 数据包。</ArgTableRow>\n</ArgTable>"}}
